{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"8456c253a19e4c86","children":[{"parent":"fc01216c232fb234","children":[{"parent":"5e494036e2d62788","children":[],"id":"42d98317b9dbfeb2","title":"其实Vector，就是做了两个事情。<br>1.底层的数组使用的是堆上的空间。&nbsp;但是它的操作和数组基本一致。 arr[1]&nbsp;都可以使用<br>2.数组一旦装不下，这时候可以扩容。&nbsp;堆空间申请的内存，可以使用realloc扩容"},{"parent":"5e494036e2d62788","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"1d7515deec6eff8f","title":"建议大家代码一定要自己写一下。如果不写代码，这个过程纯靠背顶不住"},{"parent":"5e494036e2d62788","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"63b119779ac1bf03","title":"过程一定要知道，且能用自己的话描述出来！"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"5e494036e2d62788","title":"如果Vector有点难理解。&nbsp;<br>那么对于普通长度的数组一定要掌握"},{"parent":"fc01216c232fb234","children":[{"parent":"3e28ad39ac8a5cf2","children":[],"id":"ca98ee7dadb1af5a","title":"p[index]。<br>将index往后的数据，整体往后挪一位。然后将要插入的数据放在该下标"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"3e28ad39ac8a5cf2","title":"往数组指定下标插入数据"},{"parent":"fc01216c232fb234","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"336d344401b71ade","title":"删除指定下标数据"},{"parent":"fc01216c232fb234","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"66b022e27d4c6fc6","title":"修改指定下标数据"},{"parent":"fc01216c232fb234","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d7ff27388ae7d495","title":"查找数据是否存在"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fc01216c232fb234","title":"数组"},{"parent":"8456c253a19e4c86","children":[{"parent":"c9e334f65606020b","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"7d468405682dd004","title":"头插法插入数据、尾插法插入数据"},{"parent":"c9e334f65606020b","children":[{"parent":"10d64ef3ac66723d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8b23d149e82095cd","title":"一般面试的问法，就是，简单描述一下链表插入数据的流程"},{"parent":"10d64ef3ac66723d","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b88cc35074ef7eea","title":"在链表上插入一个数据，需要找到它的前驱结点<br>创建新结点，把数据存进去。<br>新结点的指针域，指向前驱结点的指针域。<br>前驱结点的指针域，再指向这个新结点"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"10d64ef3ac66723d","title":"往指定下标插入数据数据，能掌握更好"},{"parent":"c9e334f65606020b","children":[{"parent":"64c794a140e6048c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b30d1e228c2c9190","title":"在面试的时候，回答大致就可以，比如使用临时指针存储一下待删除的。<br>然后将前一个指针的next域，存储待删除的next域<br>最后将待删除的结点释放就可以了。&nbsp;不要纯背代码"},{"parent":"64c794a140e6048c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"256e1f711465d6e4","title":"不过自己写代码的时候，按照索引删建议掌握。因为可以锻炼自己的思维缜密性，<br>写多了这种比较缜密的代码，bug会少。"},{"parent":"64c794a140e6048c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3970312e92162409","title":"删除指定索引的数据"},{"parent":"64c794a140e6048c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"007ef1add860e1c1","title":"删除指定数据"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"64c794a140e6048c","title":"删除一个链表上的结点，掌握最基本的。比如开天眼了，<br>给了你要删除数据的前一个结点，之后怎么删除下一个结点"},{"parent":"c9e334f65606020b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2e57c9e416da2703","title":"改某个索引的数据。这个比较简单"},{"parent":"c9e334f65606020b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7044c99869b2d386","title":"查找某个数据，查找某个索引的数据"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c9e334f65606020b","title":"链表"},{"parent":"8456c253a19e4c86","children":[{"parent":"b548f9f30982608c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f25035bc30ff0ffd","title":"比如，现在假设，这里有个数组，有个链表。&nbsp;将它们的插入流程简单对比一下"},{"parent":"b548f9f30982608c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"264ce58b97eb0aa5","title":"比如删除流程"},{"parent":"b548f9f30982608c","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"e112c74c1822352f","title":"一定要注意的是，能够用自己的话说出来流程"},{"parent":"b548f9f30982608c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"26ba40e4bb2ce605","title":"简单介绍一下线性表（减分项）<br><br>线性表，就是一个线性的数据结构。 数据是一个接着一个的。 在物理上，有两种组织方式，数组和链表。 数组的内存是连续的。链表的内存是离散的，主要是靠指针来指示下一个结点。<br>数组的查找是比较快的，插入和删除速度是比较慢的。 数组是有随机访问特点的，简单说，就是要访问第n个数据， 可以根据直接根据一个公式计算出来地址，然后去访问该地址。 base_addr+index*sizeof(int)<br>链表的插入，删除比较快。 查找是比较慢。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b548f9f30982608c","title":"关于这种，面试官喜欢对照问。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"8456c253a19e4c86","title":"线性表"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"749623807ff5c516","title":"要知道基础的概念：&nbsp;什么是栈，什么是队列"},{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[{"parent":"b51226d3cdb0a450","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"39cbb469a65b146f","title":"数据后进先出"},{"parent":"b51226d3cdb0a450","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d2098f9aaee61b29","title":"栈用来存储函数调用过程"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b51226d3cdb0a450","title":"栈是操作受限的线性表，只允许从一端进出"},{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[{"parent":"a3e74ea2a8e6145f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b8f434504e5aba81","title":"数据是先进先出"},{"parent":"a3e74ea2a8e6145f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"566afd3ecfa91e4d","title":"可以保证公平。先来的先出，可以保证数据先到的先处理"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"a3e74ea2a8e6145f","title":"队列是&nbsp;只允许从一端进，从另外一端出"},{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[{"parent":"0ba4c926d346e668","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5aa31f79a024412a","title":"使用数组"},{"parent":"0ba4c926d346e668","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"646990adeffe0da1","title":"使用链表"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0ba4c926d346e668","title":"怎么实现的"},{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[{"parent":"5d7c80ec6656e2d0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2ea3a3b15d420ae4","title":"一个普通的数组，再额外加上一个int类型的变量<br>来存储栈顶的位置。&nbsp;进栈的时候，将数据放进去，再将这个int类型的变量+1"},{"parent":"5d7c80ec6656e2d0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"74e4880f3ef46274","title":"栈使用链表实现，是类似的"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"5d7c80ec6656e2d0","title":"栈的实现"},{"parent":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","children":[{"parent":"fc2dc25649c93302","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"86b4dbf1a45091a6","title":"线性表"},{"parent":"fc2dc25649c93302","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"f1d4974e3fb4df57","title":"使用链表来实现队列。&nbsp;就是从尾进数据，尾插。从头出数据，"},{"parent":"fc2dc25649c93302","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9d9698fd6a16d39f","title":"使用数组来实现。&nbsp;循环队列的实现思路。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"fc2dc25649c93302","children":[{"parent":"344157f10415ff25","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8d28669a7de73364","title":"循环队列其实就是用数组的方式来实现队列。&nbsp;<br>它就是用两个下标来标识开始和结尾的位置。在进出数据数据的时候，只需要挪动两个下标，不需要挪动数据。&nbsp;<br>这种做法，如果光+1.这时候会出现假满问题。&nbsp;这时候我们采用的手段是，将&nbsp;下标+1后对长度取余。&nbsp;这时候如果超过了length.<br>这时候会从index=0继续走。&nbsp;这就是循环的概念。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"344157f10415ff25","title":"什么是循环队列"},{"parent":"fc2dc25649c93302","children":[{"parent":"426b1c5289c11835","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"68b63af23bdc4402","title":"size"},{"parent":"426b1c5289c11835","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"7809a2ad2a191f2a","title":"如果满了。&nbsp;扩容，循环队列能不能用realloc。<br>应该用 malloc ，然后将原始的数据拷贝过来。&nbsp;从 front---&gt;rear"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"426b1c5289c11835","title":"循环队列的判空判满问题。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"fc2dc25649c93302","title":"队列的实现"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6e5d124e2c6f310e","title":"栈&amp;队列"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[{"parent":"b4f3af9bb45d25fe","children":[],"id":"34cfd6a4159ee282","title":"struct node_s{<br>&nbsp;int data;<br>&nbsp;struct node_s&nbsp; *left;<br>&nbsp;struct node_s&nbsp; *right;<br>}"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"b4f3af9bb45d25fe","title":"要知道，什么是树"},{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d7e7f9c1bddfdd82","title":"要知道二叉搜索树是什么"},{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[{"parent":"1c30482e00c1fb65","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"80cc9b311523bd96","title":"查询的性能高。&nbsp;但是是有前提的，这棵树应该不歪。<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1c30482e00c1fb65","title":"要知道二叉搜搜索树的优点在哪"},{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[{"parent":"1105da1dc707de12","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2212ec9c8397273f","title":"就是一个特殊的二叉搜索树，有一些自己的平衡策略。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"1105da1dc707de12","title":"红黑树是什么东西"},{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[{"parent":"633e0a2cc50af504","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e270498f1d7e1d5b","title":"一个结点里面，有左右两个指针来实现的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"633e0a2cc50af504","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"78c3b47ec9fdc7fd","title":"和单链表很像。所以，操作很链表非常相似。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"633e0a2cc50af504","children":[{"parent":"94f052f7aef3eafc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d313d7a71f02e3d8","title":"一般数组模拟，要么是满二叉树，要么是完全二叉树。"},{"parent":"94f052f7aef3eafc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"eaeb801be6d879c5","title":"完全二叉树：&nbsp;就是前面n-1层都是满的，最后一层，所有的结点都放在最左侧。&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"94f052f7aef3eafc","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"734280cd6f3662c4","title":"满二叉树：&nbsp;每一层都是满的"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"94f052f7aef3eafc","title":"数组也可以模拟二叉树"},{"parent":"633e0a2cc50af504","children":[{"parent":"f4e2cd19395c3612","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7c4afac80d90de5e","title":"什么是树、什么是二叉搜索树、什么是红黑树（作用是什么）。"},{"parent":"f4e2cd19395c3612","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"74050a206bcea8e4","title":"添加的代码，查找的代码，都是比较简单的。&nbsp;可以去尝试一下"},{"parent":"f4e2cd19395c3612","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"68aa1f7102dcd15e","title":"删除的代码有点难度。不用管"},{"parent":"f4e2cd19395c3612","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e8074822f7d6b671","title":"扩展：B树、B+树，这些了解一下。优点，应用场景。&nbsp;后期工作了之后可以花点时间学学"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f4e2cd19395c3612","title":"如果代码写不出来，基本的东西要知道"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"633e0a2cc50af504","title":"二叉树的实现方式有几种"},{"parent":"0c71333059a66158","children":[{"parent":"0ed19ce7d5c77f1a","children":[],"id":"52afd64dfafc1734","title":"数据库。索引，采用是B+树。&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>"},{"parent":"0ed19ce7d5c77f1a","children":[{"parent":"cbefd426a92c4677","children":[],"id":"62231c90d5dcb7af","title":"为什么降低树的高度有好处，因为树是存储在磁盘中。<br>树层高高，读磁盘的次数会多，磁盘的速度非常慢。所以导致了数据库的速度非常慢"},{"parent":"cbefd426a92c4677","children":[],"id":"6669801450e257f3","title":"如果对B树，四层能装多少数据？<br>1000*1000*1000 = 10亿"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"cbefd426a92c4677","title":"B树：每一层的孩子节点都多。&nbsp;二叉树，一个结点最多两个。&nbsp;<br>B树可能一层有1000个孩子。&nbsp;相同层高下，能装的数据会非常多"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0ed19ce7d5c77f1a","title":"扩展一下"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"0c71333059a66158","title":"树"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"767a81cb5e1ae84c","title":"代码比较难。&nbsp;建议大家理解一下代码，要写一下代码。<br>如果实在写不出来，重点应该是理解结构 +&nbsp;添加流程。"},{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[{"parent":"af217b6ca51a154d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4ba30a8a9110b205","title":"1.简单说说你所认识的哈希表。<br><br>存储键值对的数据结构。 底层结构是数组+链表。<br><br>比如，现在要存储进去一个键值对。&nbsp; <br>1.使用哈希函数，对这个key进行计算，得到一个int。 <br>2.使用得到的int，对数组长度进行取余。 之后其实这个键值对就像往这个下标存储<br>3.去该位置检查是否有数据。 如果没有数据，这时候直接将数据存进去。 <br>如果这个位置有数据。 挨个比较，键是否相同。 如果键不相同，这时候比较下一个； 键相同，用新值覆盖旧值；"},{"parent":"af217b6ca51a154d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4b950f6239fb4556","title":"底层结构就是数组+链表"},{"parent":"af217b6ca51a154d","children":[{"parent":"48ed09ffb708e2e2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"8c8c9e55c1a303a8","title":"1.哈希表效率为啥高：&nbsp;其实就是让你说底层结构 +&nbsp;添加流程"},{"parent":"48ed09ffb708e2e2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2fae4893d75cc958","title":"2.为啥哈希表底层结构是数组+链表"},{"parent":"48ed09ffb708e2e2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"d98a3d7bd170474c","title":"3.哈希表底层结构是啥"},{"parent":"48ed09ffb708e2e2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"ecce337a2534e556","title":"要听懂面试官的问题。&nbsp;碰到自己会说的多说点。&nbsp;<br>往自己懂的上面聊"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"48ed09ffb708e2e2","title":"常见的面试题基本都一个回答思路"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"28px"},"id":"af217b6ca51a154d","title":"结构和添加流程一定要记住"},{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[{"parent":"4b6a822e095a6cea","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"65651f9180607463","title":"添加的代码"},{"parent":"4b6a822e095a6cea","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"6feed9fba50c52ec","title":"查找的代码"},{"parent":"4b6a822e095a6cea","children":[{"parent":"2801d0e67e4fd728","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"079ad04b578898b0","title":"如果能掌握就掌握。如果掌握不了，就先放一下。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2801d0e67e4fd728","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"3b0b05291d9c01a7","title":"如果会了添加和查找，&nbsp;对于删除的大致逻辑是没问题的。&nbsp;但是对于它的指针挪动确实有点复杂"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"2801d0e67e4fd728","title":"删除"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"4b6a822e095a6cea","title":"代码一定要掌握的"},{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[{"parent":"423fafc998772b7e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"9562013a5ba9f026","title":"就是用来评判哈希表数据稀疏程度的。&nbsp;<br>键值对数目 /&nbsp;数组长度。&nbsp;<br><br>5/10&nbsp; &nbsp; 10/10<br>1000 / 10"},{"parent":"423fafc998772b7e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"a1088d7f6b4974e0","title":"加载因子越大。 trade off<br>能装更多的数据，但是效率受到了影响。<br>如果加载因子超过了一定的数值，&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"423fafc998772b7e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"6e4374b54fe54934","title":"实践过程中，一般采用的是一个阈值。&nbsp; 3/4<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"423fafc998772b7e","title":"加载因子"},{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"c4f6d8af131ca081","title":"对于传统的数组的添加、查找流程。代码一定要掌握。<br>如果删除能掌握更好"},{"parent":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dac210d067b1c29e","title":"对于动态的数组，建议了解一下。&nbsp;在面试的时候，被问到数据量太多的时候，效率低咋办。<br>知道有扩容这个动作在这里可以保证效率就可以了。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"dfceec48a6efa4e5","title":"哈希表"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"root","title":"数据结构重点","version":473,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:59","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}